sed on the meandering path of ones. It seems the output forms a U-turn based on a clear set of steps. I'm focusing on the U-turn made by (8,0), (7,0), (6,0), (6,1), (6,2), (7,2), and (8,2). I'm tracing the 1's starting with (8,0) and trying to determine how input pixel placement impacts the meander's trajectory, and if there's an impact on the zero layout.\n\n\n\n",
